40:["$","ol","ol-4",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"理解条件变量的本质"}],"：Condvar 本质上是一个配合 Mutex 使用的线程同步工具，它解决了\"如何让线程在条件不满足时休眠，条件满足时被唤醒\"这一经典并发编程问题。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"掌握两种实现策略"}],"："]}],"\n",["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"v1 基础版本"}],"：直接使用 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"atomic-wait"}]," 实现等待与唤醒机制"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"v2 优化版本"}],"：通过 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"num_waiters"}]," 计数器避免不必要的系统调用"]}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"深入理解内存顺序"}],"：通过分析 happens-before 关系，我们发现可以使用 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"Relaxed"}]," 内存顺序，因为 Mutex 的 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"Release"}],"/",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"Acquire"}]," 操作已经提供了必要的同步保障。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}]
